{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o030a","title":"立曹叡平原王及曹彰等十一王","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o030a-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"立曹叡平原王及曹彰等十一王","evidence":["wendi-e-o030a-q"]},{"id":"mingdi-e-o001c-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"黄初三年，曹叡封平原王。","evidence":["mingdi-e-o001c-q"]},{"id":"rencheng-a-61cb9bd6b717e1319781","label":"正文","text":"曹彰立任城王","evidence":["rencheng-q-77567bd2af77055502fe"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"受封","evidence":["wendi-e-o030a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0380","role":"受封","evidence":["wendi-e-o030a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":222,"label":"黄初三年三月乙丑","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o028","basis":"黄初三年三月乙丑"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o030a-q","wendi-q-o028","wendi-q-b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o030a-q","source_order":[2,284,"O030a"],"order":600}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0380","name":"曹彰","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o001c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185},{"id":"rencheng-q-77567bd2af77055502fe","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-fc65ddc82bffa504d4f1","layer":"original","quote":"三年〖19〗，立为任城王。","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":133,"end":146},{"id":"wendi-e-o030a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-08bfc42f1e31260da240","layer":"original","quote":"三月，乙丑〖14〗，立齐公叡，为平原王；帝弟鄢陵公彰等十一人，皆为王。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":283,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：黄初三年（公元 222 ）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2c01bc8dd8508fc686e1","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"wendi-q-o028","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-9204f4c854f659a541df","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，丙寅朔，日有食之。庚午〖2〗，行幸许昌宫。诏曰：“今之计、（考）〔孝〕〖3〗，古之贡士也。十室之邑，必有忠信。若限年然后取士〖4〗，是吕尚、周晋不显于前世也〖5〗。其令郡国所选，勿拘老幼；儒通经术，吏达文法〖6〗，到，皆试用。有司纠故不以实者〖7〗。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
